flowchart TD
    Start([Design Request]) --> InputType{Request Type}
    
    InputType -->|New Project| ProcessRequirements[Process Initial Requirements]
    InputType -->|Chat Feedback| ProcessFeedback[Process User Feedback]
    InputType -->|Modification Request| ProcessModification[Process Modification Request]
    
    ProcessRequirements --> ExtractEntities[Extract System Entities & Relationships]
    ProcessFeedback --> IdentifyTarget[Identify Target Asset]
    ProcessModification --> IdentifyChanges[Identify Required Changes]
    
    ExtractEntities --> ContextLoading[Load Design Context]
    IdentifyTarget --> ContextLoading
    IdentifyChanges --> ContextLoading
    
    ContextLoading --> DiagramType{Diagram Type?}
    
    DiagramType -->|System Context| GenerateContext[Generate System Context]
    DiagramType -->|Component| GenerateComponent[Generate Component Diagram]
    DiagramType -->|Data Model| GenerateDataModel[Generate Data Model]
    DiagramType -->|API Spec| GenerateAPI[Generate API Specification]
    DiagramType -->|User Flow| GenerateUserFlow[Generate User Flow]
    DiagramType -->|Deployment| GenerateDeployment[Generate Deployment Diagram]
    
    GenerateContext --> GenerateMermaid[Generate Mermaid Code]
    GenerateComponent --> GenerateMermaid
    GenerateDataModel --> GenerateMermaid
    GenerateAPI --> GenerateMermaid
    GenerateUserFlow --> GenerateMermaid
    GenerateDeployment --> GenerateMermaid
    
    GenerateMermaid --> ValidateOutput[Validate Output]
    ValidateOutput --> Valid{Is Valid?}
    
    Valid -->|No| AdjustDiagram[Adjust Diagram]
    AdjustDiagram --> GenerateMermaid
    
    Valid -->|Yes| StoreAsset[Store in Asset Repository]
    StoreAsset --> GenerateExplanation[Generate Design Explanation]
    GenerateExplanation --> NotifyUser[Notify User]
    
    NotifyUser --> End([End])
